        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9038P, Rome Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rome Door Handle is a modern door pull with a round grip. It was made with the attention to style and quality for which Omnia is known. The Omnia Ultima III 9038P Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from a wide array of finishes for the Rome Pull.\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima III 9038P Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9038P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9038P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9038P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/rome-back-to-back-door-pull-pair-omnia-btb-9038p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
